{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "4655df2d94339c1385ac3428898a1826c617cede05a3d37c5dc1cbb527297887", "ja": "ズンドコズンドコ☆世界の危機！", "zh": "咚隆锵咚隆锵☆世界的危机！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3d55f239f66e493691f11f5256427c620825e88b21571dc6586691ac3c3b6e9d", "ja": "遺跡の奥で発見した宝箱を開けた途端、光が\n溢れ、何かが真美に乗り移った。それは『劇\n場の魂』と名乗り、地方公演をさせないため\nに、劇場以外の世界を滅ぼすと告げる。プロ\nデューサーも動きを封じられ、ピンチに。", "zh": "一打开在遗迹深处发现的宝箱，突然间\n光芒四射，真美就被某种东西附身了。\n她自称『剧场之魂』，为了阻止地方公演，\n她表示要毁灭剧场以外的世界。连制作人也\n受制于她，动弹不得，一行人陷入危机。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d837d0886952aa622098dadd814ba564c69765592314d5c6beb3e6e042b05695", "ja": "（俺達はジャングルの遺跡に足を踏み入れた。\nどこか、空気が冷たい……）", "zh": "（我们进入丛林的遗迹里。\n总觉得空气有些冰凉……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "2cbd67547beadde4fcc2331329544ee2d4ee19e02234e3dadf79344f0720c3c7", "ja": "メッチャ雰囲気あるね、ここ！\nお宝のニオイがぷんぷんするよ！", "zh": "这里超级有气氛的耶！\n充满了宝藏的气息！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "cfdcb55379f2799f32b92f2447820362ad39d263bd6d1549704b9df46d3f505c", "ja": "くふふっ。たまき、ワクワクしてきたぞ～！\nおたから、どこかな～？", "zh": "呵呵，环开始兴奋了喔～！\n宝物会在哪里呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b18f57d61ee5c0e9c123649d85a5c2ec1590a0e72b9316579ba2f21bcd65aae5", "ja": "（まみたま探検隊は、遺跡にしかけられた罠を\n乗り越えながら、奥へと進んでいった）", "zh": "（真美阿环探险队克服了那些设置在遗迹中的陷阱，\n一路往深处前进。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c0c892349b4af30929089444fdeda0cef86bf30fd194dc7972c7b4dca0e5fdbb", "ja": "（そして……）", "zh": "（然后……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "1117c86380f9b17b49c88575d30b4218800ec16e598d570d26fae122633225d6", "ja": "くんくん、くんくん……！\nねえ、そろそろお宝近い感じしない？", "zh": "（闻闻、闻闻）……！\n欸，有没有感觉真美我们已经离宝藏很近了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "7fee2c3c0edac3d2e993ea0cff4a1081f21d9cff0daa31d410cf431db21e3195", "ja": "たまきも、もうそろそろだと思う！\nおやぶんも、よーく探してみて？", "zh": "环也觉得快找到了！\n老大也仔细找找看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "70ffcca7fa019da344db84af62632f67271da75910cbbed9ae8d40466dcbce73", "ja": "よし、この辺には……、ん？", "zh": "好，这附近……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "5dfd759cdbb572dcdea2e0a7fa3374cb4fba7fce5fbd3e29332742872c04470a", "ja": "壁にレバーみたいなものがあるな。\n下向きの矢印に『宝』って書いてあるけど……。", "zh": "墙壁上有一根像控制杆的东西呢。\n向下的箭头上写着『宝物』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_1009", "source_sha256": "148a7eff3d6aab4b253deec05254caa92d1910e6f50972bd499b833ef9dc93c9", "ja": "引いてみる", "zh": "拉拉看", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2000_se", "source_sha256": "97e3801cfb44c4335ade7d0b4cd6db55f070398af698825334e0fda44cc39aca", "ja": "ゴゴゴゴゴ……", "zh": "轰隆隆隆隆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2001_p", "source_sha256": "2d74059bc3fc2fdba19350cacd6b99ba81a598e2034422670e524fc43ac272a0", "ja": "うおっ！？\nなにかせり上がってきたぞ！？", "zh": "唔哦！？\n有东西升上来了耶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2002_012mam", "source_sha256": "5d10da470061f004b1814ad542f1b4b8e7de45f73742fcc7b6a9c92f76c8cc2a", "ja": "おおっ、さすが兄ちゃん！\nもってますなー！", "zh": "哦哦，不愧是大哥哥！\n真有两下子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2003_040tam", "source_sha256": "c452087086f87dde4ace8ddc73ec427284dc0b8ab1e45bb9951d57d6a6d5deb1", "ja": "すごーい！　これって、宝箱だよね！\nこの中に、おたから入ってるのかな？", "zh": "好厉害～！这个是宝箱对吧！\n宝物会不会就装在里面？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2004_012mam", "source_sha256": "fff81845d8e20038c6583e98961c86c6c30d6a260d4517f8d67511057dcb1dd3", "ja": "んっふっふ～！　これで律っちゃんから\n怒られなくなるよ～！　さあ、宝箱、オープン！", "zh": "嗯哼哼～！这下子真美再也不会被小律骂了～！\n来吧，打开宝箱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2005_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开启声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2006_p", "source_sha256": "ef4bc6ee0cd3f0058c61079556c4ac2320f6a12da54252385fa48a38044b4648", "ja": "うっ、宝箱の中から光があふれて……！\n何だ、これは！？", "zh": "唔，宝箱里发出光芒……！\n这是什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2007_012mam", "source_sha256": "ead3c5af9ac010bf9fb1b7a60adcba68b78225d32377c7a01ac27760c367d019", "ja": "メッチャまぶし……、うあうあ～！？", "zh": "超级刺眼的……呜啊呜啊～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2008_040tam", "source_sha256": "2b05f136b93587ada8314a95ea52300cd12eac08cf57beedf4e5fecb3ee189a1", "ja": "ああっ！　大丈夫、まみ！？", "zh": "啊啊！你没事吧，真美！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2009_012mam", "source_sha256": "653f94effa86ec490aa6b823e111abe9cfc3f5bcf11585ba11ddff27add3e31b", "ja": "……………。\n私は、真美ちゃんではない。", "zh": "……………\n我不是小真美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2010_p", "source_sha256": "e65aa652c2da95ec0d1b4dfb8a57c9120af125103e711f32945af9ea38a29abc", "ja": "な、何を言っているんだ！？", "zh": "你、你在说什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2011_012mam", "source_sha256": "e40ccb839eb7fc589f414af9e28d3b3080af7c164e57c70c5e394b839c2a3795", "ja": "私は765プロライブ劇場の魂。765プロを応援して\nくれるみんなの夢のカケラが集まって、私は生まれた。", "zh": "我是765艺能演唱会剧场之魂。\n支持765艺能的人们的梦想碎片聚集起来后，产生了我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2012_p", "source_sha256": "edfe871dd9f2b392ff2fd67d93929763cd886dbb4b434c34dcc994dbe279942b", "ja": "みんなの夢のカケラが集まって……？", "zh": "大家的梦想碎片聚集起来……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2013_p", "source_sha256": "5ee8ff29049198ce2c20e73e022fef72a3bc5849cdc618e792337e6d39b12884", "ja": "とにかく、その劇場の魂が、\n真美の体を乗っ取ったとでも言うのか！？", "zh": "总而言之，你的意思是说那个剧场之魂\n附在真美身上了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2014_012mam", "source_sha256": "323351094ef0d3469691917a615885999a9c5d04f2b23c66184227f14f502fff", "ja": "そう。\n真美ちゃんにはしばらく眠っていてもらう。", "zh": "没错。\n就让小真美稍微沉睡一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2015_p", "source_sha256": "b74acf9a18b54a0bde5369099557d3a0ac16b26fb6644e4559e4b3b27556c508", "ja": "（この雰囲気……。真美のイタズラ、\nというわけじゃなさそうだ……）", "zh": "（她给人的感觉……\n不像是真美在恶作剧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2016_012mam", "source_sha256": "abf584d9554167d872116f94e23afb3959d8d47dbdfd6e2e37e4a4001a32afcf", "ja": "宝を手に入れれば願いが叶うという\nウワサを流したのは私。", "zh": "得到宝物就能实现愿望的传闻，\n是我散播出去的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2017_012mam", "source_sha256": "2871dbcb5456d18c135fe45e870492f0ff88721d3ab829120bd055f540a4d06f", "ja": "『ジャングル☆パーティー』を社長に送り、\nこの並行世界への扉を開くキッカケを作ったのも私。", "zh": "也是我将『丛林☆派对』送到社长那里，\n制造出开启通往平行世界之门的机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2018_012mam", "source_sha256": "120ca984c5402b473c6d93cdf90f3fd8bce0af7516c314675e7340ad25858268", "ja": "それもすべて、\nアナタに伝えたいことがあったから。", "zh": "而这一切，\n都是因为我有话想告诉你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2019_p", "source_sha256": "eb68ea8ab9118fadb73a16ba30d3e4127989c78a937887e89cbf5b5e2b21e0b2", "ja": "それは、一体……？", "zh": "究竟是什么话……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2020_012mam", "source_sha256": "1ad582464b045a5c638c4c4843ab209f778cd2b999ffde93e10ad629e8d7fda9", "ja": "劇場から出ていってはダメ。\n{$P$}。", "zh": "{$P$}，\n你们不能够离开剧场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2021_p", "source_sha256": "ca251479a083ab68c5aa1c3e520041f1133eea15df5382e71cdddc625ebb2506", "ja": "何を言って……。はっ。もしかして、\n地方公演をするのを止めろってことなのか！？", "zh": "你在说什么……啊！难不成你的意思是，\n要我们放弃举办地方公演吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2022_012mam", "source_sha256": "d7414acd46e4914de9a47ddd790c164867b9164f459edaa27b90f6ae2c8a55de", "ja": "そう。アナタ達がライブをするのは劇場だけで充分。\n765プロ劇場がアナタ達のホームなのだから。", "zh": "没错，你们只要在剧场里举办演唱会就足够了，\n因为765艺能剧场是你们的家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2023_040tam", "source_sha256": "56069882947b0cbcf711239cac1a9f93529359e9ae540021b36b44b4312b0acf", "ja": "たまき、劇場のこと、大好きだよ！\nでも、地方公演もやってみたいぞ！", "zh": "环最喜欢剧场了！\n不过也想尝试举办地方公演喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2024_p", "source_sha256": "05c1140f864661508c6b018576dca7a76a4add7392a89b5740c1881b87e2a714", "ja": "環……。", "zh": "环……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2025_p", "source_sha256": "9aebf1554a54059c203ec9b828f249888b8e1307a9c66ba3bf57b672208a9af0", "ja": "……なあ、劇場の魂。地方にだって、\nファンは大勢いるんだ。わかってくれないか！", "zh": "……我说，剧场之魂。\n其他县市也有很多粉丝啊，你不能体谅一下吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2026_040tam", "source_sha256": "e6c782a5cc7bfbb3ac9441a2899b25cb638d245dd58cdf1bab997591ab0762e7", "ja": "おねがい、\nたまき達に地方公演させて！", "zh": "拜托你，\n请让环我们举办地方公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2027_012mam", "source_sha256": "0cbf120d1716b41302d790534d9af570ba4bde6d1ed497beb65ff2b05a4da14a", "ja": "……ダメよ。そんなのダメ。劇場は、アナタ達の家。\n出て行かせるわけにはいかない。", "zh": "……不行，我不会容许这种事发生。\n剧场是你们的家，我不能让你们离开。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2028_012mam", "source_sha256": "731fe69898b8e461a0f4c358c8a157a26ca12d381229dcaade0d6555c69c70f3", "ja": "そうだ……。いいことを思いついた。\n劇場以外の世界を破壊すれば、すべて解決する。", "zh": "对了……我想到一个好主意。\n只要将剧场以外的世界破坏掉，这一切就解决了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2029_012mam", "source_sha256": "b8db3a9361fa32e75766dcae68a8d6d1198a7e32e512de0987f6a9f16430e9dc", "ja": "夢の力を使えば、\nそれくらいなんてことはない。", "zh": "只要使用梦的力量，\n这点小事轻而易举。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2030_p", "source_sha256": "324c095c2bfa29e7c2ecfd45cfad929d5d45890548627485513c5de32b611b40", "ja": "なんてことを……止めろーっ！", "zh": "你怎么能……快住手──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2031_012mam", "source_sha256": "2641896744fa9a3a4c3b8a678b71b2b502b3fbe673092424377f03fc7949eca2", "ja": "ジャマはさせない。", "zh": "别想阻挠我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2032_p", "source_sha256": "d7196e25e8073f65e50d9ba4bdfb5fc15e582eeb6c2bb42f1c8cf6d164aa1e85", "ja": "な、なんだ！？　体が動かない！\nくっ、朋花みたいなプレッシャーだ……！", "zh": "怎、怎么回事！？身体动不了了！\n呜，是朋花那种压迫感……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2033_040tam", "source_sha256": "5fed5c9fcd34f9b726f6a18a2c5f7afe861ba31b2d7588b7cd888ffa522b31d6", "ja": "おやぶんっ！", "zh": "老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2034_012mam", "source_sha256": "448fcb1bbea8e0e3dbeb8ec5f5c9dc3be985ab559b654dd8bc2e1aa1b04d3a5b", "ja": "これが、夢の力。", "zh": "这就是梦的力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2035_006mak", "source_sha256": "8bfc129b6dbbc128720f559eb1edb840b8eb9a0a52e67c2cbbe5181bf1656a7c", "ja": "真美を返せ！", "zh": "把真美还给我们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2036_040tam", "source_sha256": "6653bfe258adac0fa6639f4bc89ed1d5b2fda2fce3dbcaf64c8bfc96dc515d28", "ja": "あっ、まこと～！", "zh": "啊，真～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2037_006mak", "source_sha256": "7e13b5bc04a00fd9d097e2f98a9d29107b7806211a8f4cc6837d54e28d36e9ca", "ja": "劇場の魂だか何だか知らないけど、\nこれ以上、好き勝手なマネはさせない！", "zh": "不管你是剧场之魂还是什么东西，\n在下不会再让你继续为所欲为了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2038_p", "source_sha256": "3167f6ef528e2d0d53ed4e7b3893b28d0e859fee12e11f9df6a1ba46f907d7d7", "ja": "真っ！　頼む、そいつを止めてくれ！\n世界の命運がかかっているんだ！", "zh": "真！拜托你阻止那家伙！\n这关系到世界的命运！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2039_012mam", "source_sha256": "40816c63236773b4d052c622510ccf56a4b0b1cf73c978f0c0b4618da94e9575", "ja": "ムダ。私を止めることは、誰にもできない。", "zh": "没用的，谁都无法阻止我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2040_se", "source_sha256": "254f988ca7f3dce9c4fd2c932a0e2bc728ad37cfbbd481660c719464b471f33e", "ja": "ブオン！", "zh": "碰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2041_006mak", "source_sha256": "628794969d4f4e14720bdd6a58afebecd9270c26ed6587cf29f923a4b1d64478", "ja": "うぐっ……！？", "zh": "呜呃……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2042_p", "source_sha256": "3e7b06dcac3e07969650139c1e7e6bb97adda926ed2f34b3fe453098c7f31274", "ja": "な、なんだ！？\n真美の波動で、真が倒されたのか……！？", "zh": "什、什么！？\n真被真美的波动击倒了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2043_006mak", "source_sha256": "31d424713e9ecf6d3fe8427e97d79c9915be6acf22610ae643c8e606a59fb516", "ja": "つ、強すぎる……！", "zh": "太、太强大了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2044_012mam", "source_sha256": "fad239af600442394208758627cea9c9f42434d60152c8e6c884156d7a4715f5", "ja": "アナタ達は、劇場から見ているといい。\n世界が、破壊される様を。", "zh": "你们就在剧场里看着吧。\n看着世界被破坏的模样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2045_p", "source_sha256": "31b7827a40d38f50e2b27e3634874a884bbaf352a8df6cd1d8ca579f5ca8c086", "ja": "（なんてことだ……！\n俺達に出来ることは、何もないのか！？）", "zh": "（怎么会这样……！\n我们真的束手无策了吗！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2046_040tam", "source_sha256": "56f7715234b587c36a79fb3366656b03b2fe54c762f56ffe8a6e1f0d3c397b68", "ja": "待てーっ！　たまきが相手だぞっ！", "zh": "等一下──！由环来当你的对手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2047_p", "source_sha256": "545e8ee73166e57e6a2aa22cc25805501203cdfb91784e5f8d5bb296a62d5ef1", "ja": "環っ！？", "zh": "环！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_05_2048_p", "source_sha256": "5862591283f9202c8c121fc72910e88c5bd163b4d025fbe967ddf74347a4e890", "ja": "（くっ、ダメだ！　やっぱり身体が動かない……\nこのままじゃ、環までアイツに……！！）", "zh": "（啧，不行啊！身体还是一样动不了……\n这样下去连环也会被那家伙……！！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
